# 9. Hero Section Requirements

Purpose:

Capture attention within five seconds.

Requirements:

* Bold headline
* Supporting description
* Primary CTA
* Secondary CTA
* Animated device mockup
* Floating feature cards
* Background gradient
* Animated particles
* Grid overlay
* Scroll indicator

Hero should occupy 100vh on desktop.

CTA buttons must remain visible above the fold.

---

