Purpose:

Reduce visitor hesitation.

Display:

* Fast Delivery
* Mobile Responsive
* SEO Ready
* Secure
* Modern Stack
* Affordable Pricing
* WhatsApp Support
* Lifetime Guidance

Animated horizontal marquee on desktop.

Grid layout on mobile.

