# 22. Global UI Requirements

* Fully responsive
* Consistent spacing system
* Reusable components
* Glassmorphism
* Soft shadows
* Rounded corners
* Modern gradients
* Smooth transitions
* Dark-first design

---

# 23. Animation Requirements

Use Framer Motion and GSAP.

Include:

* Fade
* Slide
* Scale
* Parallax
* Counter animations
* Magnetic buttons
* Tilt effects
* Cursor interactions
* Floating elements
* Scroll reveal
* Smooth scrolling

Animations must enhance usability without reducing performance.

---

# 24. Performance Requirements

* Lighthouse >95
* LCP <2.5s
* CLS <0.1
* INP <200ms
* Lazy loading
* Image optimization
* Code splitting
* Font optimization

No blocking resources on initial render.

---

# 25. Accessibility Requirements

WCAG AA compliance.

Support:

* Keyboard navigation
* Screen readers
* Focus states
* ARIA labels
* Semantic HTML
* Color contrast
* Reduced motion preference

---

# 26. SEO Requirements

* Semantic HTML
* Structured data
* Open Graph
* Twitter Cards
* XML sitemap
* robots.txt
* Canonical URLs
* Optimized metadata
* JSON-LD
* Local Business schema

Every page must have unique metadata.

---

# 27. Conversion Strategy

Every page must include at least one primary conversion action.

Conversion methods:

* Quote request
* WhatsApp
* Call now
* Contact form
* Consultation booking

No page should become a dead end.

