# 29. Acceptance Criteria

The product is considered complete when:

* Responsive across all major devices
* Zero console errors
* Lighthouse score above 95
* Core Web Vitals pass
* Contact forms operational
* WhatsApp integration functional
* SEO configured
* Accessibility compliant
* Premium visual quality achieved
* Conversion-focused user journey implemented
* Successfully deployed on Vercel
* Ready to be presented to paying clients as the flagship portfolio website

---

# 30. Product Definition of Success

LaunchForge Digital should not resemble a template or student project.

It should feel like the website of a mature, premium digital agency capable of delivering enterprise-quality solutions, instilling confidence in business owners within seconds and converting that confidence into qualified leads and long-term client relationships.
